        }
      }
    },
    "You'll unlock and sign in again to use Stellar. Your Stellar funds stay in your account." : {
      "comment" : "The sign-out confirmation's message.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tendrás que desbloquear e iniciar sesión de nuevo para usar Stellar. Tus fondos de Stellar se quedan en tu cuenta."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vous devrez déverrouiller et vous reconnecter pour utiliser Stellar. Vos fonds Stellar restent sur votre compte."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Stellar를 사용하려면 다시 잠금 해제하고 로그인해야 해요. Stellar 자금은 계정에 그대로 남아요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "之后需要重新解锁并登录才能使用 Stellar。你的 Stellar 资金会留在你的账户中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your Monad wallet sends the USDC. It arrives on Stellar in about a minute." : {
      "comment" : "The bridge from Monad to Stellar. Monad and Stellar are network names.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tu billetera de Monad envía los USDC. Llegan a Stellar en un minuto aproximadamente."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Votre portefeuille Monad envoie les USDC. Ils arrivent sur Stellar en une minute environ."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Monad 지갑이 USDC를 보내요. 약 1분 뒤 Stellar에 도착해요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "由你的 Monad 钱包发送 USDC，约一分钟后到达 Stellar。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your Stellar key isn't on this iPhone yet. Sign in again on this iPhone to use Stellar." : {
      "comment" : "An error: this device doesn't hold the account's Stellar key (the host usually shows its own, more exact copy).",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tu clave de Stellar aún no está en este iPhone. Vuelve a iniciar sesión en este iPhone para usar Stellar."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Votre clé Stellar n'est pas encore sur cet iPhone. Reconnectez-vous sur cet iPhone pour utiliser Stellar."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Stellar 키가 아직 이 iPhone에 없습니다. Stellar를 사용하려면 이 iPhone에서 다시 로그인하십시오."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的 Stellar 密钥尚未在此 iPhone 上。在此 iPhone 上重新登录以使用 Stellar。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your deposits are lent through Blend, a Stellar lending protocol. Rates move with demand. Withdrawals need the pool to have free liquidity." : {
      "comment" : "Earn's note. Blend is a lending protocol's name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tus depósitos se prestan a través de Blend, un protocolo de préstamos de Stellar. Las tasas cambian con la demanda. Para retirar, el pool necesita liquidez libre."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vos dépôts sont prêtés via Blend, un protocole de prêt sur Stellar. Les taux varient avec la demande. Un retrait nécessite que le pool ait des liquidités disponibles."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "예치금은 Stellar 대출 프로토콜인 Blend를 통해 대출돼요. 이율은 수요에 따라 달라져요. 출금하려면 풀에 여유 유동성이 있어야 해요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的存款通过 Stellar 借贷协议 Blend 出借。利率随需求变化。提取需要池子有可用流动性。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your first buy (optional, no anti-snipe fee)" : {
      "comment" : "The launch form: the amount the creator buys first.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tu primera compra (opcional, sin comisión antisnipe)"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Votre premier achat (facultatif, sans frais anti-snipe)"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "첫 매수 (선택, 안티 스나이핑 수수료 없음)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的首次买入（可选，无防狙击费）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your phone checks every transaction against what you see here before it signs. Anything else is refused." : {
      "comment" : "The review sheet's note.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tu teléfono comprueba cada transacción con lo que ves aquí antes de firmarla. Cualquier otra cosa se rechaza."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Votre téléphone vérifie chaque transaction par rapport à ce que vous voyez ici avant de la signer. Tout le reste est refusé."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "휴대폰은 서명하기 전에 모든 트랜잭션을 여기 보이는 내용과 대조해요. 그 밖의 것은 거부돼요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的手机会在签名前将每笔交易与此处显示的内容核对。其他任何内容都会被拒绝。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Yours" : {
